{#
settings/_shortcuts.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Whether single keys act on mail, and where the list of them is.

A plain form that submits on change and redirects, like the cards beside it:
the switch decides whether a controller is mounted on the next page, so there
is nothing on this one worth streaming back.

The button is here as well as behind `?` on purpose. `?` only answers for
somebody who has the shortcuts on, and the person reading this card may be
deciding whether to — they need the list first.

Accepts:
  enabled  bool
#}
{% set segText = 'flex h-full items-center justify-center px-3 py-1.5 text-center text-[11px] leading-tight text-ink-muted
                  peer-checked:bg-accent peer-checked:text-accent-ink
                  peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-inset peer-focus-visible:ring-accent
                  transition-colors cursor-pointer' %}

<div class="px-4 py-3">

<form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_shortcuts_update') }}" data-turbo="false" data-controller="ui--auto-submit">
    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-shortcuts') }}">

    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="min-w-0">
            <span class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">{{ 'settings.shortcuts.label'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="block text-[11px] text-ink-faint mt-0.5">{{ 'settings.shortcuts.hint'|trans }}</span>
        </span>

        <div class="grid grid-flow-col auto-cols-fr shrink-0 rounded-pane border border-line overflow-hidden"
             role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ 'settings.shortcuts.label'|trans }}">
            {% for on in [true, false] %}
                <label>
                    <input type="radio" name="enabled" class="peer sr-only"
                           value="{{ on ? '1' : '0' }}"
                           data-action="change->ui--auto-submit#submit"
                           {{ enabled == on ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                    <span class="{{ segText }}">
                        {{ (on ? 'settings.shortcuts.on' : 'settings.shortcuts.off')|trans }}
                    </span>
                </label>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</form>

<div class="mt-3">
    <button type="button"
            data-controller="ui--modal"
            data-ui--modal-src-value="{{ path('app_shortcuts_help') }}"
            data-ui--modal-title-value="{{ 'shortcuts.title'|trans }}"
            data-action="click->ui--modal#open"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 h-8 px-3 rounded-pane border border-line
                   text-[11px] text-ink-muted hover:bg-hover cursor-pointer transition-colors">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-keyboard text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{ 'settings.shortcuts.show'|trans }}
    </button>
</div>

</div>
